The denoising network architecture and diffusion implementation are adapted
from the original project code, which includes components from Fast-DDPM
(mirth AI lab at UF) and the DDPM/DDIM implementation lineage.
The upstream MIT license is preserved in LICENSE.

This repository contains SH-DTI++ preprocessing, training and inference only.
The published model's tensor channel order is Dxx, Dyy, Dzz, Dxy, Dxz, Dyz.
